{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/5e29b6f01994bc079eb0b40a628b7a9c.avif?t=1757333614\" width=288 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are sitting at your computer; suddenly, strange purple mushrooms sprout from your desk. What do you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/5c34532e7a080ce3cf36bb54b629bf64.poster.avif?t=1757333614\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/5c34532e7a080ce3cf36bb54b629bf64.webm?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/5c34532e7a080ce3cf36bb54b629bf64.mp4?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game experience, you will be plunged into a surreal world that seems to want to test you. A strange fortune-teller wants to help you: the path is well-marked, but why does it seem like you don't want to follow it? Perhaps another version of you, more impulsive and rebellious, has already passed through the same places, the same corridors, has perhaps already faced the same challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/739dfe0a9ea6382ceebde1b40cb6facc.poster.avif?t=1757333614\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/739dfe0a9ea6382ceebde1b40cb6facc.webm?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/739dfe0a9ea6382ceebde1b40cb6facc.mp4?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chasing an unnatural red moon, venture into gloomy forests, explore mushroom-covered caves, and cross dreamlike corridors. Fight your way through memories with sword blows; arrange the pieces of your mind on the game board through strategy, and place your cards at the right moment. Will all of this be enough to face yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/624183a7c606c85e8983aeaba104d607.poster.avif?t=1757333614\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/624183a7c606c85e8983aeaba104d607.webm?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/extras/624183a7c606c85e8983aeaba104d607.mp4?t=1757333614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>A FEW WORDS ABOUT OUR TEAM</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amanita is the first project developed by the Gibberi Games studio, which has, at the time of this announcement, two members: a computer scientist and a philosopher. It could have gone better. As you might expect, the technical side was handled by the former, while the writing and art direction were handled by both.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880050?t=1757333614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880050?t=1757333614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880050/8d87c3f328b48427f4d84a4ca2234f351dae2fba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757333614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as